# BOB Solar Frontend Refactor — Implementation Plan

A visual/CSS-only refactor to make the app feel more polished, compact, and professional. **Zero business logic changes.** Every change targets styling, layout, spacing, and visual effects only.

> [!CAUTION]
> ## Critical Rule for All Agents
> **DO NOT modify any business logic, event handlers, data fetching, server actions, hooks, or API calls.** This refactor is strictly visual. If a function handles data (e.g., `onEdit`, `onDelete`, `deleteCustomer`, `handleSubmit`), leave it untouched. Only modify JSX class names, layout structure, and CSS files. When removing elements (like the "View History" button), remove only the JSX and its `event.stopPropagation()` click handler — do NOT remove the imports used elsewhere or the `Link`/`router` logic that powers card navigation.

