**1b. Redesign the icon container in `NavIcon` (lines 65–89)**

Replace the flat transparent icon container with a colored rounded-square:

```tsx
<motion.div
  ref={iconRef}
  style={{ scale, y: translateY }}
  className={cn(
    "relative flex items-center justify-center rounded-[12px] transition-shadow duration-200",
    "h-10 w-10",
    item.bg, item.text,
    isActive
      ? "shadow-lg ring-2 ring-white/25"
      : "opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 hover:shadow-md",
  )}
>
  <Icon
    className="relative z-10 h-5 w-5"
    strokeWidth={isActive ? 2.5 : 2}
  />

  {/* Active Indicator Dot */}
  {isActive && (
    <motion.div
      layoutId="nav-orbit-indicator"
      className="absolute -bottom-2.5 h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]"
      transition={{ type: "spring", stiffness: 400, damping: 30 }}
    />
  )}
</motion.div>
```

Key changes:
- Background: colored via `item.bg` (e.g., `bg-blue-500`) instead of transparent
- Corner radius: `rounded-[12px]` (iOS app icon style)
- Icon color: white (`item.text`) instead of `text-muted-foreground`
- Active state: `shadow-lg ring-2 ring-white/25` instead of `text-[var(--color-solar-amber)]`
- Active dot: white instead of solar-amber (contrasts better with colored backgrounds)
- Hover on inactive: opacity transition (`opacity-80 → hover:opacity-100`) + subtle shadow

**1c. Reduce magnification intensity (lines 52–58)**

Make the dock physics smoother by reducing the magnification range:

```diff
-  const scaleSync = useTransform(distance, [-150, 0, 150], [1, 1.6, 1]);
+  const scaleSync = useTransform(distance, [-120, 0, 120], [1, 1.3, 1]);
   const scale = useSpring(scaleSync, dockSpringConfig);

-  const translateYSync = useTransform(distance, [-150, 0, 150], [0, -8, 0]);
+  const translateYSync = useTransform(distance, [-120, 0, 120], [0, -6, 0]);
   const translateY = useSpring(translateYSync, dockSpringConfig);
```

- Magnification: `1.6x → 1.3x` (less exaggerated)
- Lift: `-8px → -6px` (subtler vertical shift)
- Zone: `150px → 120px` (tighter effect radius for snappier feel)

**1d. Drop-shadow removal**

Remove `drop-shadow-md` from the `<Icon>` element — it's unnecessary with a colored background and adds rendering cost:

```diff
-<Icon className="relative z-10 h-5 w-5 drop-shadow-md" ...
+<Icon className="relative z-10 h-5 w-5" ...
```

> [!WARNING]
> Do NOT remove or change the `mouseX` MotionValue logic, `onMouseMove`, `onMouseLeave`, `useTransform`, or `useSpring` hook calls. These are the dock's core physics engine. Only change the **numerical values** inside `useTransform`.

